      "text": [
        " سَأَلْتُ أَبَا الْحَسَنِ ( عليه السلام ) عَنِ الْخِصْيَانِ وَ الْمَرْأَةِ الْكَبِيرَةِ أَ عَلَيْهِمْ طَوَافُ النِّسَاءِ قَالَ نَعَمْ عَلَيْهِمُ الطَّوَافُ كُلِّهِمْ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "Ahmad Bin Muhammad, from Al Hassan Bin Ali Bin Yaqteen, from his brother Al Husayn Bin Ali Bin Yaqteen who said, ",
          "‘I asked Abu Al-Hassan<sup>asws</sup> about the eunuchs and the aged women, is there <span class=\"iTxt\">Tawaaf Al-Nisaa</span> upon them?’ He<sup>asws</sup> said: ‘Yes, upon them is the <span class=\"iTxt\">Tawaaf</span> (<span class=\"iTxt\">Al-Nisaa</span>), all of them’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "4. Ahmad ibn Muhammad has narrated from al-Hassan ibn Ali ibn Yaqtin who has said the following: “I once asked abu al-Hassan, ‘Alayhi al-Salam, about the castrated people and old women if Tawaf al- Nisa’ is obligatory upon them. He (the Imam) said, ‘Yes, it is obligatory on all of them.’” "
        ]
      }
